1
00:00:00,369 --> 00:00:02,499
(Penny:)So, Leonard, how about it?

2
00:00:03,747 --> 00:00:07,497
(Leonard:)Penny, we'd love to help you, but Raj
is going through some stuff right now.

3
00:00:07,668 --> 00:00:10,208
(Leonard:)And besides, he doesn't drink, so...

4
00:00:10,379 --> 00:00:11,839
[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

5
00:00:12,006 --> 00:00:13,386
(Leonard:)Really?

6
00:00:14,467 --> 00:00:15,507
(Sheldon(on phone):)Um...

7
00:00:15,676 --> 00:00:20,556
(Leonard:)Raj is going through some stuff right now
and he'd like to take up drinking.

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,520
(Penny:)Okay, here you go, Leonard.
One Tequila Sunrise.

9
00:00:25,686 --> 00:00:26,766
(Leonard:)- Thank you.
- Mm-hm.

10
00:00:26,937 --> 00:00:30,687
This drink is an example of how liquids
with different specific gravities...

11
00:00:30,858 --> 00:00:33,238
(Leonard:)...interact in a cylindrical container.

12
00:00:35,196 --> 00:00:36,776
(Leonard:)Thank you.

13
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,740
(Penny:)Okay, Raj, what'll it be?

14
00:00:39,909 --> 00:00:41,539
[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

15
00:00:41,702 --> 00:00:42,872
(Leonard:)Whatever you recommend.

16
00:00:43,412 --> 00:00:46,372
How about a Grasshopper?
I make a mean Grasshopper.

17
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,710
(Penny:)Okay? Good, coming up.

18
00:00:47,875 --> 00:00:51,875
- Sheldon, what are you gonna have?
- I'll have a Diet Coke.

19
00:00:52,713 --> 00:00:56,253
Okay, can you please order a cocktail?
I need to practice mixing drinks.

20
00:00:56,425 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon:)Fine. I'll have a virgin Cuba Libre.

